  "header": "AI moves from answers into action, making controls and evidence the real differentiators",
  "friendlyHeader": "AI can do more work, so clear checks matter more",
  "summary": "Today’s issue follows AI into business software, laboratories, forecasting, healthcare research and everyday photography. Across the launches and studies, the useful question is increasingly not whether a model can act, but whether its permissions, evidence and limits are clear enough for people to trust the result.",
